OL,3,GNEWSAElderly man and woman killed in
OL,4,Arural crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man in his nineties and a woman in
OL,7,Fher seventies have been killed in a
OL,8,Fcrash in North Yorkshire, according to
OL,9,Fpolice.
OL,11,FThe pair died in the crash on the A171
OL,12,Fbetween Whitby and Guisborough on
OL,13,FFriday at about 23:45 BST.
OL,15,FNorth Yorkshire Police said a grey
OL,16,FPeugeot 2008 and a blue VW Golf
OL,17,Fcollided near Scaling Dam as the
OL,18,FPeugeot travelled east and the VW
OL,19,Ftravelled west.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
