OL,3,GNEWSAElderly man and woman killed in
OL,4,Arural crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe passenger of the Peugeot, a woman
OL,7,Fin her seventies, was pronounced dead
OL,8,Fat the scene, and the driver, a man in
OL,9,Fhis nineties, was taken to hospital,
OL,10,Fbut died later as a result of his
OL,11,Finjuries.
